{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261117/photo/bkn-20261117020159726-1117_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261117020641\"/><p>董軍（圖）跟意大利國防部長會談。</p><p>中國國防部長董軍應邀訪問意大利期間，周一（16日）與意大利國防部長克羅塞托舉行會談。</p><p>會談前，克羅塞托為董軍舉行歡迎儀式。雙方就兩國兩軍關係、國際地區形勢和共同關心的問題深入交換意見。雙方同意，落實好兩國領導人重要共識，繼續鞏固發揚中意傳統友好，推動兩軍關係深化發展，共同維護地區和全球安全穩定。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T18:21:38.717617+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":173,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T18:01:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T12:27:13.174947+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T18:15:08.820981+00:00","content_hash":"2e69b9eb9386f9fcd79d5ed4bbb60a7862f03931052a485bcb30b153518e76da","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T18:21:38.717617+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}